{"id":"t05-429cf7","status":"read","groups":[{"levels":[[{"surface":"أبو توبة","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}],[{"surface":"الهيثم بن حميد","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"خشيش بن أصرم","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"أبو عاصم","kind":"narrator"}]]},{"levels":[[{"surface":"ثور بن يزيد","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}],[{"surface":"شيخ، من بني سليم","kind":"unnamed"}],[{"surface":"عتبة بن عبد السلمي","kind":"narrator"}]],"variant":true}],"shared_tail":[[{"surface":"ثور بن يزيد","kind":"narrator","occurrence":1}],[{"surface":"نصر الكناني","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"رجل","kind":"unnamed"}]],"needs_ruling":false,"notes":["Two branches («ح») meet at «جميعا عن ثور بن يزيد»: their shared tail is Thawr, Nasr, then an unnamed «رجل».","«وقال أبو توبة» gives the same saying through a different transmitter (a shaykh of Banu Sulaym), so it is a variant group, not a route. «- وهذا لفظه -» is a gloss."],"fixes":[]}